Record actual HTTP responses or equivalent test evidence, without revealing private information.

**Priority Zero acceptance condition:** No critical authentication, authorization or child-privacy issue identified in the tested scope may remain unresolved.

If any critical issue remains, mark the application NOT ACCEPTED FOR REAL-FAMILY PRODUCTION USE.

